 engraving.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"#/wiki/material-library/acrylic\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"leather\"> \n        Leather\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Genuine leather, PU leather, and specialty leather\n        materials for laser cutting and engraving.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"#/wiki/material-library/leather\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"wood\"> \n        Wood\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Plywood, MDF, solid wood, and other wood-based materials\n        for laser cutting and engraving.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/wood/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"fabric\"> \n        Fabric\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Natural and synthetic fabrics for laser cutting,\n        engraving, and creative applications.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/fabric/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div><div>\n\n\n</div><div>\n\n</div><div>\n\n  <h2 id=\"featured-guides\"> \n    Featured Guides\n  </h2>\n\n  <p>\n    Learn how to choose, process, and troubleshoot laser materials for better results.\n  </p>\n\n\n  \n\n  <div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"material-selection\"> \n        Material Selection\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Learn how to choose the right material based on type, thickness,\n        surface finish, application, and laser compatibility.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"laser-cutting\"> \n        Laser Cutting\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Learn how to achieve cleaner and more consistent cuts with proper\n        focus, power, speed, Air Assist, and material preparation.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"laser-engraving\"> \n        Laser Engraving\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Discover techniques for creating clear and detailed engravings,\n        including resolution, contrast, depth, and surface preparation.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    \n\n    <div>\n\n      <h2 id=\"troubleshooting\"> \n        Troubleshooting\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Find solutions to common material processing problems such as\n        incomplete cuts, burning, melting, deformation, and uneven results.\n      </p>\n\n      <a href=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/knowledge-base/material-processing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        Explore →\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div></div>","toc":[{"id":"material-categories","level":2,"text":"Material Categories"},{"id":"acrylic","level":2,"text":"Acrylic"},{"id":"leather","level":2,"text":"Leather"},{"id":"wood","level":2,"text":"Wood"},{"id":"fabric","level":2,"text":"Fabric"},{"id":"featured-guides","level":2,"text":"Featured Guides"},{"id":"material-selection","level":2,"text":"Material Selection"},{"id":"laser-cutting","level":2,"text":"Laser Cutting"},{"id":"laser-engraving","level":2,"text":"Laser Engraving"},{"id":"troubleshooting","level":2,"text":"Troubleshooting"}]}